sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Phone client
    participant A as Application process
    participant D as Database process
    participant O as Media file storage

    C->>A: Publish uploaded media with retry key
    A->>D: Commit post and retry key together
    A-->>C: Acknowledge committed post ID
    C->>A: Feed request and cursor
    A->>D: Read follows and indexed posts
    A-->>C: Descriptions and media references
    C->>O: Fetch media when needed
